---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Cmd from '../../components/Cmd.astro';
import OwnerActions from '../../components/OwnerActions.astro';
import PostList from '../../components/PostList.astro';
import { newPostUrl } from '../../lib/github';
import { getPosts } from '../../lib/posts';

const posts = await getPosts();
---

<BaseLayout title="글" description="SunJae.Log에 올린 글을 최신순으로 봅니다.">
  <header class="page-intro">
    <div class="list-head">
      <Cmd command="kubectl get posts" />
      <OwnerActions links={[{ href: newPostUrl(), label: 'new post' }]} />
    </div>
    <h1>모든 글</h1>
    <p>주제별로 묶고, 각 주제 안에서는 최신이 위입니다. 초안은 <code>draft: true</code>인 동안 목록에 나오지 않습니다.</p>
  </header>
  <PostList posts={posts} grouped />
</BaseLayout>
